#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:5
#: 5685b064850f49c3972b2577d9b5b793
msgid "Multiwii Serial Protocol (MSP)"
msgstr "Multiwii 串行协议（MSP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:7
#: 790641e718e143639de4ce9d554f0e2f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports the MSP protocol for telemetry, OSDs, and sensors via any"
" of its serial ports. This allows ArduPilot to send its telemetry data to "
"MSP compatible devices, such as DJI goggles, for On Screen Display (OSD) "
"(See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`). It can also be used by external "
"OSDS, such as MWOSD, when setup for MSP protocol (ie betaflight/Inav)."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通过任意串口支持 MSP 协议，用于数传、OSD 和传感器。这允许 ArduPilot 将其数传数据发送到兼容 MSP 的设备（如 "
"DJI 眼镜）进行屏幕显示（OSD）（见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`）。当配置为 MSP 协议（即 "
"betaflight/Inav）时，也可供 MWOSD 等外部 OSD 使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:10
#: 6366b847323e4648a385bc18bd59d50b
msgid "Protocol overview"
msgstr "协议概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:12
#: 81dd029c169b4175b7fb38039de2ed94
msgid ""
"MSP is the main communication protocol used by all Betaflight derived flight"
" stacks. It's a binary message based protocol used for control, telemetry "
"and sensors. ArduPilot's MSP protocol module is ported from Betaflight and "
"iNav, and supports both MSPV1 and MSPV2."
msgstr ""
"MSP 是所有基于 Betaflight 的飞控固件所使用的主要通信协议。它是一种基于二进制消息的协议，用于控制、数传和传感器数据。ArduPilot "
"的 MSP 协议模块从 Betaflight 和 iNav 移植而来，同时支持 MSPV1 和 MSPV2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:16
#: ab02391f3ba044ae8b654870301ab026
msgid "At the moment, the ArduPilot implementation supports:"
msgstr "目前 ArduPilot 的实现支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:18
#: e17a8b4967c04f23803de19351e7fdee
msgid "MSP Telemetry"
msgstr "MSP 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:19
#: 50da20a6234c43c79773a68699d56902
msgid ""
"MSP Telemetry OSDs such as DJI FPV Goggles, FatShark's ByteFrost and "
"SharkByte, MWOSD"
msgstr "MSP 数传 OSD，例如 DJI FPV 眼镜、FatShark 的 ByteFrost 和 SharkByte、MWOSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:20
#: 4d9248d6977d4d749a9e0dd0e6de4131
msgid "MSP DisplayPort OSDs such as FatShark's Shark Byte and MWOSD"
msgstr "MSP DisplayPort OSD，例如 FatShark 的 Shark Byte 和 MWOSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:21
#: e4fb8f850c1b497e9713d8a630dda69b
msgid ""
"MSP Sensors such as lidar, optical flow, gps, barometer, magnetometer and "
"airspeed"
msgstr "MSP 传感器，例如激光雷达、光流、GPS、气压计、磁力计和空速计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:23
#: 1ee048ffa4c8415fbc4cb04e02213ad0
msgid ""
"ArduPilot configuration via MSP protocol is not supported, so for instance "
"the Betaflight configurator won't work."
msgstr "不支持通过 MSP 协议配置 ArduPilot，因此 Betaflight 配置器将无法使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:27
#: 47b9e8c7398249368bd4729025ab9c2f
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:29
#: b3637008bacf4901b6305009bd07400a
msgid ""
"MSP requires a free serial port, and its speed defaults to 115200 baud. "
"Below SERIAL2 is used for the examples."
msgstr "MSP 需要一个空闲串口，默认速率为 115200 波特。以下示例使用 SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:31
#: 9e32d8ea77e941abae7116389657f8b2
msgid "There are 3 MSP backends selected by serial protocol:"
msgstr "有 3 种 MSP 后端，通过串口协议选择："

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:33
#: ecc4283ad81e42a0b328dcdff09e3eac
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 is for DJI FPV or RE Goggles"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 用于 DJI FPV 或 RE 眼镜"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:34
#: 20280f9b17a74a59afbb976bdf07dc47
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 is for sensors or generic MSP"
" telemetry usage and MWOSD configured for MSP telemetry"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 用于传感器或通用 MSP 数传以及配置为 MSP 数传的 "
"MWOSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:35
#: 3f90cd0c93eb43fa97a8735f92ebecf2
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 is for DisplayPort OSDs (aka "
"CANVAS MODE) such as FatShark's SharkByte"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 用于 DisplayPort OSD（又称 CANVAS "
"MODE），例如 FatShark 的 SharkByte"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:37
#: 39df25c1ab3045e28b5b1b10b9366d8a
msgid ""
"There are 2 different protocols to try to maintain compatibility with DJI's "
"evolving hardware."
msgstr "有 2 种不同协议，以尽量保持与 DJI 不断演进的硬件的兼容性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:39
#: 58a3b47b37f34815bb83dcdee6ac4e2c
msgid ""
"When :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 is selected the protocol"
" decoder can work in polling mode (default) or in \"telemetry push\" mode. "
"When working in polling mode, both TX and RX must be connected to the MSP "
"telemetry transceiver. While in push mode only the TX line is used. To "
"enable push mode, simply set :ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 0 to \"1\";"
" to disable set it to \"0\" (default)."
msgstr ""
"当选择 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 "
"时，协议解码器可以以轮询模式（默认）或「数传推送」模式工作。在轮询模式下，TX 和 RX 都必须连接到 MSP 数传收发器。而在推送模式下只使用 TX "
"线。要启用推送模式，将 :ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位设为「1」；禁用则设为「0」（默认）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview-4.2.rst:41
#: 1b4254bd0ebb47109a93ae149b055463
msgid ""
"MSP sensors such as the Matek 3901-L0X are supported by both protocols."
msgstr "两种协议均支持 MSP 传感器，例如 Matek 3901-L0X。"
